## Third-party artwork — NOT covered by the MIT license above

The MIT license covers the source code of this repository only.

The image files under `public/geshin-pics/` are artwork from Genshin Impact,
© miHoYo / HoYoverse. They are included as compressed WebP references for
color extraction — not as downloadable originals or wallpapers. They are NOT
licensed under MIT, and are NOT yours to redistribute under these terms.

Before you fork this repository, remove `public/geshin-pics/`. `pnpm
assets:fetch` re-fetches the three fixed asset families from the public Fandom
API on demand.

Palettes, gradients and the color math derived from that artwork are original
output of this project's code and carry no such restriction.

## Vendored components

`src/components/studio/backgrounds/vendor/` holds background components adapted
from React Bits (MIT). `@paper-design/shaders-react` is Apache-2.0. Both keep
their own licenses; adapted files carry a `[local]` note on the edits.

No file is copied from React Bits' Magic Bento or Aceternity UI's Glowing
Effect; the landing page's bento (`src/components/landing/magic-bento.tsx`) is a
rewrite that keeps their techniques — the spotlight and proximity falloff from
the former, the conic-arc border mask from the latter — and credits both in
place.
